<title>USA: Furniture Brands Intl Inc Q3 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Furniture Brands Intl Inc Q3 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $ 0.22		   $ 0.12</p>
<p> Oper net		   14,325		    6,196</p>
<p> Revs			417,921		  258,626</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 64,754		   51,404</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 oper net excludes charge of $7.4 million or $0.11/shr from early retirement of debt.  </p>
<p>			NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $ 0.59		   $ 0.38</p>
<p> Oper net		   36,793		   19,426</p>
<p> Revs		    1,262,610		  794,866</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 62,765		   51,404</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months oper net excludes charge of $7.4 million or $0.12/shr from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>1996 sales include those of Thomasville Furniture Industries Inc, acquired on December 29, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
